  "question": "What garden exist within a 160 kilometers distance northeast of Dyken Pond Environmental Education Center, Cropseyville, NY?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.434447 42.723028)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.434447 42.723028)',4326)::geography, 160000)\nAND leisure = 'garden'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 22.5 AND 67.5;\n",
